WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:05.690
Serial killers, evil spirits, and plenty of
giant explosions — these are the flicks

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.990
that you won't want to miss in 2023.

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:11.309
Warning: This video contains fast, flashing
images.

00:00:11.309 --> 00:00:15.750
Viewer discretion is advised, especially for
those with photosensitive epilepsy.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:21.039
Like his previous film, "Old," which is based
on a Swiss graphic novel, M. Night Shyamalan

00:00:21.039 --> 00:00:24.650
will turn to some interesting source material
for his next film.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:28.750
In the summer of 2022, it was revealed that
"Knock at the Cabin," Shyamalan's upcoming

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.540
thriller, is based on Paul Tremblay's horror
novel "The Cabin at the End of the World."

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.719
Though we don't yet know how Shyamalan's version
of the tale will twist the narrative, "The

00:00:36.719 --> 00:00:40.340
Cabin at the End of the World" follows a couple
and their daughter as they're set upon by

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.990
a group of mysterious armed strangers at their
secluded cabin.

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:48.550
The invaders claim that one member of this
small family must be sacrificed in order to

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:54.140
save the world, leading to a tense standoff
with unimaginable consequences.

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:58.680
Shyamalan's film stars Jonathan Groff, Ben
Aldridge, and Kristen Cui as the family in

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:04.987
danger, along with Dave Bautista, Rupert Grint,
Nikki Amuka-Bird, and Abby Quinn as the home invaders.

00:01:04.987 --> 00:01:11.463
Expect to see some truly chilling horror when
"Knock at the Cabin" arrives February 3, 2023.

00:01:11.765 --> 00:01:17.220
The MCU's Multiverse Saga began with "Spider-Man:
No Way Home" and "Doctor Strange in the Multiverse

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:23.297
of Madness," but things are about to get deadly
serious in the upcoming "Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania."

00:01:23.297 --> 00:01:28.580
This time around, Scott Lang and his allies
will team up to face Kang the Conqueror, a

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:33.400
multiversal, time-traveling villain played
by "Lovecraft Country" star Jonathan Majors.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:37.850
Majors first played the role in the form of
a character dubbed simply "He Who Remains"

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:44.439
at the end of "Loki" Season 1, and now, he's
returning to play another variant of the mysterious adversary.

00:01:44.439 --> 00:01:49.549
Exactly what Kang wants — and how Scott
will end up facing him — is still a mystery.

00:01:49.549 --> 00:01:53.700
What's not a mystery is that our heroes will
definitely be spending a lot of time in the

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:57.640
Quantum Realm, where they'll run into a character
played by Bill Murray.

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:01.939
One of Marvel's weirdest villains — the
evil oversized head called M.O.D.O.K.

00:02:01.939 --> 00:02:03.270
— will also be showing up.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:09.366
We'll find out exactly what happens next when
"Quantumania" hits theaters on February 17, 2023.

00:02:09.366 --> 00:02:11.830
"See you soon."

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:22.140
Back in 2015, the world of Rocky Balboa expanded
with "Creed," in which the legendary boxer

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:25.630
decides to coach the son of his late friend
and rival.

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:29.640
Starring Michael B. Jordan as Adonis Creed,
the Ryan Coogler-directed sports drama was

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:34.110
a major success, earning Sylvester Stallone
his first Golden Globe.

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:39.170
In 2023, the "Creed" franchise is set to continue
with its third installment, building on the

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:42.680
first sequel in which Adonis fought the son
of Ivan Drago.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:47.110
This time around, Jordan himself will also
be stepping into the director's seat, giving

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:50.940
him even more ownership of the sub-franchise
he helped launch.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:55.680
Tessa Thompson and Phylicia Rashad will also
return as Adonis' girlfriend and stepmother,

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:59.769
respectively, but one person who won't be
back is Stallone himself.

00:02:59.769 --> 00:03:04.140
With Rocky Balboa's journey seemingly wrapped
up at the end of "Creed II," it looks like

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:07.450
the Italian Stallion is done — at least
for now.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:11.670
Across from Jordan in the ring will be Jonathan
Majors, who will serve as a new antagonist

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.069
for the series.

00:03:13.069 --> 00:03:18.000
Adonis will enter the ring once again when
"Creed III" drops on March 3, 2023.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:23.090
"Dungeons &amp; Dragons" has long been one of
the biggest names in fantasy, so it makes

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:26.930
sense that a new attempt at an adaptation
of the franchise will be reaching cinemas

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:27.930
in 2023.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:32.680
"Dungeons &amp; Dragons: Honor Among Thieves,"
from "Game Night" writers John Francis Daley

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:37.120
and Jonathan Goldstein, looks like it has
the makings of a clever fantasy adventure.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:41.970
"Honor Among Thieves" will follow a group
of… well, thieves, as they set out to stop

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:46.890
an apocalyptic event that they inadvertently
caused by stealing a dangerous artifact.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:51.659
Going on this quest will be actors Chris Pine,
Michelle Rodriguez, Sophia Lillis, Justice

00:03:51.659 --> 00:03:53.489
Smith, and Regé-Jean Page.

00:03:53.489 --> 00:03:57.659
Of course, plenty of iconic creatures from
the role-playing game will be making appearances,

00:03:57.659 --> 00:04:01.536
from owlbears to mimics to gelatinous cubes.

00:04:01.536 --> 00:04:07.405
"Dungeons &amp; Dragons: Honor Among Thieves"
sneaks into theaters also on March 3, 2023.

00:04:07.546 --> 00:04:11.140
In the spring of 2023, four years after "Shazam!"

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:15.599
burst into theaters, we'll finally get a sequel
from many of the same people who made the

00:04:15.599 --> 00:04:17.400
first film so fun.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:21.900
At the end of 2019's "Shazam!", Billy Batson
gained a family of heroes to help him in his

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.560
quest to save the world.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:26.080
"Say my name."

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.080
"BILLY!"

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:31.834
"No, not my name, no, say the name that I
say to turn into this guy!"

00:04:31.834 --> 00:04:32.834
“SHAZAM!”

00:04:34.457 --> 00:04:39.759
Now, the world is threatened again, and the
family will face a challenge unlike anything

00:04:39.759 --> 00:04:41.280
they've seen before.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:45.930
Instead of a mad scientist, Shazam and friends
will face off against the daughters of Atlas

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:49.169
— played by Helen Mirren, Lucy Liu, and
Rachel Zegler.

00:04:49.169 --> 00:04:53.660
Many of the original major players from the
first film are also back for the second installment,

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:58.669
including Jack Dylan Grazer as Freddy Freeman
and Djimon Hounsou as the wizard Shazam.

00:04:58.669 --> 00:05:03.060
We can expect another epic good time, but
don't yet know how this film will connect

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:07.620
with Dwayne Johnson's Black Adam, another
major player in the Shazam saga.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:08.970
Regardless, "Shazam!

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:13.160
Fury of the Gods" hits theaters on March 17,
2023.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:17.020
"How good to see you again so soon, Mr. Wick.

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:18.630
Shall I announce you?"

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.520
"Yes, please."

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:25.240
We were supposed to get the fourth chapter
of the "John Wick" saga back in 2021, but

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:28.210
the COVID-19 pandemic pushed things back a
bit.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:33.150
Now we know that the spring of 2023 will finally
bring us the next phase of the assassin's

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.580
ever-growing story.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:39.060
We don't know all that much about where "Chapter
4" will take John so far, other than the clues

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.280
left by the end of "Chapter 3."

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:45.610
We do know, of course, that Keanu Reeves will
return in the title role, along with Ian McShane

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:51.030
as Winston, Lance Reddick as Charon, and Laurence
Fishburne as the Bowery King.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:55.090
Newcomers to the "John Wick" universe include
Donnie Yen, Clancy Brown, Bill Skarsgård,

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.620
Rina Sawayama, and Hiroyuki Sanada.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:03.214
"John Wick" will return when "Chapter 4" hits
theaters on March 24, 2023.

00:06:03.479 --> 00:06:08.051
A decade away from the box office didn't stop
the fifth installment of the "Scream" franchise

00:06:08.051 --> 00:06:09.860
from being a box office hit.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.330
It wasn't long before a sixth film was announced.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:16.340
We don't know much about "Scream 6" just yet,
but filmmakers have revealed that Melissa

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:21.880
Barrera, Jenna Ortega, Jasmin Savoy Brown,
and Mason Gooding will all reprise their roles

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.190
from the 2022 "requel."

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:28.790
They'll be joined by franchise mainstay Courteney
Cox and "Scream 4's" Hayden Panettiere.

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:32.660
Sadly, the biggest star of the franchise,
Neve Campbell, will not be returning as Sidney

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.800
Prescott after a pay dispute.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:38.710
It'll be strange to lose Sidney, but Samara
Weaving and Tony Revolori will be there to

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.530
round out the cast in her absence.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:44.260
"Scream 6" will be unleashed on March 31,
2023.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:49.790
After the "Dark Universe" experiment failed
with "The Mummy" in 2017, Universal Pictures

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:54.170
set out to craft a new approach to its classic
movie monsters, giving us films like "The

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:55.509
Invisible Man" in the process.

00:06:55.509 --> 00:06:59.879
Now, they're taking some of their characters
down a very different route with "Renfield,"

00:06:59.879 --> 00:07:03.949
a movie about one of the most famous sidekicks
in horror history.

00:07:03.949 --> 00:07:07.850
Directed by Chris McKay and starring Nicholas
Hoult in the title role, "Renfield" will tell

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:12.310
the story of Count Dracula's servant, who
gets a new lease on life and a chance at his

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:17.169
own agency when he falls in love with a traffic
cop and sets off on an unlikely journey.

00:07:17.169 --> 00:07:22.789
If that doesn't sound fun enough, "Renfield"
will feature the one and only Nicolas Cage

00:07:22.789 --> 00:07:27.389
playing Count Dracula, a dream role for the
legendary actor.

00:07:27.389 --> 00:07:32.467
"Renfield" arrives in all its vampiric glory
on April 14, 2023.

00:07:32.467 --> 00:07:37.440
A decade after the "Evil Dead" franchise got
a reboot film from director Fede Alvarez,

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:43.470
Sam Raimi's Deadites are set to once again
rampage through movie theaters in "Evil Dead Rise."

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:47.150
This time around, the action will move to
a Los Angeles apartment building, where a

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:51.580
reunion between two sisters is interrupted
by an ancient book unleashing the Deadites.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:56.289
The film marks the first time an "Evil Dead"
film will take things to a more urban setting,

00:07:56.289 --> 00:07:58.669
which should be an interesting change of pace.

00:07:58.669 --> 00:08:01.889
Writer-director Lee Cronin is responsible
for this new take on the franchise.

00:08:01.889 --> 00:08:06.690
Now, with Sam Raimi and Bruce Campbell acting
as executive producers, it's time to see what

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.449
Cronin can do with the Deadites.

00:08:08.449 --> 00:08:12.554
"Evil Dead Rise" invades theaters on April
21, 2023.

00:08:13.793 --> 00:08:14.793
"Groovy."

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:22.150
James Gunn said back in 2017 that he would
be back for a third installment in the "Guardians

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:26.560
of the Galaxy" series, but we didn't know
then that the wait would be this long.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:31.870
It's been a bit of a bumpy road: Gunn was
fired and eventually rehired by Marvel, but

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:36.649
now "Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3" seems
to finally be on course.

00:08:36.649 --> 00:08:42.500
A sneak peek at San Diego Comic-Con 2022 teased
tension between Star-Lord and Gamora, as well

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.950
as an origin story for Rocket Raccoon.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:50.430
In addition to all the usual suspects, "Vol.
3" will also feature Maria Bakalova as Cosmo

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:56.089
the Spacedog, Will Poulter as Adam Warlock,
and Chukwudi Iwuji as the High Evolutionary.

00:08:56.089 --> 00:09:01.029
The Guardians of the Galaxy will return for
the MCU's first-ever holiday special on Disney+

00:09:01.029 --> 00:09:03.399
during the 2022 Christmas season.

00:09:03.399 --> 00:09:09.870
"Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3" will follow
in theaters a few months later, on May 5, 2023.

00:09:10.044 --> 00:09:16.110
The "Fast Saga" has been an unstoppable franchise
juggernaut for years now, but things are finally

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:19.660
starting to slow down when it comes to the
story's main characters.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:23.560
The upcoming tenth and eleventh installments
in the series will wrap up the story of the

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:26.160
Toretto family and their exciting exploits.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:31.089
The usual major players are back for the penultimate
installment in the series, including Vin Diesel,

00:09:31.089 --> 00:09:36.600
Michelle Rodriguez, Tyrese Gibson, Chris "Ludacris"
Bridges, Jordana Brewster, and Sung Kang.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:41.220
They'll be joined by more recent franchise
additions like John Cena and Charlize Theron.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:46.360
In terms of newcomers, the film will also
feature Jason Momoa, Brie Larson, and Rita

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:48.089
Moreno in key roles.

00:09:48.089 --> 00:09:52.960
It's also the first "Fast" outing for director
Louis Leterrier, who replaced Justin Lin midway

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:53.960
through production.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.151
"Family just got bigger."

00:09:57.151 --> 00:10:01.280
"Fast X" speeds into theaters on May 19, 2023.

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:05.750
"Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse" is one
of the most acclaimed superhero films of the

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:10.920
past decade, a major animated hit for Sony
Pictures that won an Oscar for Best Animated

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:15.360
Feature and set up a whole multiverse of new
possibilities for its sequel.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:18.930
In 2023, we'll finally get to see it for ourselves.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:23.970
Like the first film, the sequel will feature
Miles Morales, Peter B. Parker, and Gwen Stacy

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:28.520
teaming up as Spider-themed heroes to save
the world — but this time around, they'll

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.830
be getting some new friends and enemies.

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:34.810
Oscar Isaac has returned to play Miguel O'Hara,
a.k.a.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:39.200
Spider-Man 2099, a character introduced in
a post-credits scene in the first film.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:43.899
Issa Rae has also joined the film as Jessica
Drew, more commonly known as Spider-Woman,

00:10:43.899 --> 00:10:47.630
while Jason Schwartzman will play the Spider-Man
villain known as the Spot.

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:53.310
"Across the Spider-Verse" swings into theaters
on June 2, 2023, and will be followed up by

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:56.529
"Spider-Man: Beyond the Spider-Verse" in 2024.

00:10:56.870 --> 00:11:01.250
The "Transformers" movie franchise just keeps
on transforming.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:05.649
Over a decade has passed since Michael Bay
launched the live-action adaptation of the

00:11:05.649 --> 00:11:09.810
world's favorite robots in disguise, but the
Autobots and Decepticons keep finding new

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.910
ways to make it back to the big screen.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:17.633
In 2023, they'll do it for the seventh time
— and this time, they'll be joined by the Maximals.

00:11:17.633 --> 00:11:22.020
"Transformers: Rise of the Beasts," is a '90-set
story that will introduce elements of the

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.180
popular "Beast Wars" storyline.

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:27.579
This time around, we'll head to Brooklyn,
where Optimus Prime will encounter some new

00:11:27.579 --> 00:11:30.990
faces and face off against the vicious Terrorcons.

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:32.839
The Autobots won't be alone in the fight.

00:11:32.839 --> 00:11:37.019
They'll have the Maximals — transforming
robots who become animals — along for the

00:11:37.019 --> 00:11:41.770
ride for the first time, with Ron Perlman
voicing the aptly named Optimus Primal.

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:48.740
It's a whole new frontier of Transformers
movie storytelling, and it arrives on June 9, 2023.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:53.769
A movie version of "The Flash" has been in
the works for over a decade at this point,

00:11:53.769 --> 00:11:57.519
long enough for the character to get a whole
different life on The CW.

00:11:57.519 --> 00:12:01.640
After a long list of screenwriters and directors
moved through the project without completing

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:07.440
it, the long-awaited DC Comics film starring
Ezra Miller will finally land in 2023.

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:11.560
We don't know much about the plot of "The
Flash" yet, but we do know that it'll feature

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:17.600
the DC Multiverse and bring back the Batmen
played by Ben Affleck and Michael Keaton.

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:21.810
We'll also see a new live-action version of
Supergirl played by Sasha Calle, setting the

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:24.579
stage for even more spinoff potential.

00:12:24.579 --> 00:12:27.420
That's not what actually has people talking
about the movie, though.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:29.830
"I know we're all thinking the same thing
right now.

00:12:30.922 --> 00:12:32.378
Who's gonna say it?

00:12:32.378 --> 00:12:33.970
I'm not gonna say it."

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:39.779
"The Flash" has made news more recently not
for its supporting cast or director Andy Muschietti's

00:12:39.779 --> 00:12:43.829
vision, but for Miller's erratic behavior
and frequent run-ins with police.

00:12:43.829 --> 00:12:48.270
Now, the question is how Warner Bros. deals
with those issues in the lead-up to the film's

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:49.580
impending release.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:53.170
No matter the circumstances, it looks like
we'll see "The Flash" hit the ground running

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:55.272
on June 23, 2023.

00:12:55.856 --> 00:13:00.820
Fifteen years after he last appeared in a
feature film, Indiana Jones will return to

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:05.579
the big screen for what's likely to be the
final time starring Harrison Ford.

00:13:05.579 --> 00:13:10.639
It's been in development for years, but the
still-untitled fifth "Indiana Jones" film

00:13:10.639 --> 00:13:12.320
is finally on track.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:17.029
Although director Steven Spielberg will still
be on board as a producer, "Indy 5" marks

00:13:17.029 --> 00:13:19.810
the first time that the Oscar winner hasn't
directed.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:24.460
He turned that honor over to "Logan" helmer
James Mangold, who also co-wrote the script.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:30.029
Harrison Ford, who turned 80 years old in
2022, will be joined by Mads Mikkelsen, Phoebe

00:13:30.029 --> 00:13:33.699
Waller-Bridge, Antonio Banderas, Boyd Holbrook,
and more.

00:13:33.699 --> 00:13:38.260
Not only will Harrison Ford almost certainly
be hanging up the hat and whip, but composer

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:42.790
John Williams has suggested that he might
retire after writing the score for "Indy 5."

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:47.610
It'll be an epic return for Indy, but it might
also be a farewell to two of the most influential

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:49.497
figures in film history.

00:13:49.497 --> 00:13:54.018
"Indiana Jones 5" rolls into theaters on June
30, 2023.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:58.610
The "Mission: Impossible" films have defied
the odds by getting bigger and better with

00:13:58.610 --> 00:13:59.940
each installment.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:05.089
Tom Cruise first played Ethan Hunt way back
in 1996, and since then, he's made the character

00:14:05.089 --> 00:14:10.540
into a kind of superhero, taking on increasingly
daring real-life stunts along the way.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:14.290
Now, we're about to get the biggest "Mission
Impossible" yet.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:18.709
The seventh film in the series will once again
team Cruise with director Christopher McQuarrie,

00:14:18.709 --> 00:14:22.490
the mastermind behind the previous two Missions
Impossible.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:27.009
Franchise mainstays Rebecca Ferguson, Ving
Rhames, Vanessa Kirby, and Simon Pegg will

00:14:27.009 --> 00:14:32.769
be along for the ride, along with series newcomers
Hayley Atwell, Pom Klementieff, and Holt McCallany.

00:14:32.769 --> 00:14:38.139
Hunt's mission will tackle a global conspiracy
and redefine the very nature of truth in the

00:14:38.139 --> 00:14:39.139
public eye.

00:14:39.139 --> 00:14:43.834
In 2022, Cruise revealed that the film is
subtitled "Dead Reckoning Part One," setting

00:14:43.834 --> 00:14:48.410
up a two-part adventure that won't properly
conclude until 2024.

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:49.860
"What's done is done…

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.576
when we say it's done."

00:14:52.576 --> 00:14:58.070
"Mission: Impossible – Dead Reckoning Part
One" finally arrives July 14, 2023.

00:14:58.509 --> 00:15:03.670
Christopher Nolan films are events unto themselves
nowadays, as Nolan uses every ounce of the

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:08.110
clout he won through his Batman blockbusters
to make grand-scale films that he might not

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:10.160
otherwise get the chance to tackle.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:14.940
In September 2021, Nolan revealed that his
next project would be "Oppenheimer," a film

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:20.300
about legendary scientist J. Robert Oppenheimer
and his work creating the first atomic bombs.

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:24.050
Cillian Murphy, who worked with Nolan on the
"Dark Knight" trilogy and "Inception," will

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:27.440
play the title character during his years
in the Manhattan Project.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:31.009
Meanwhile, the film's massive supporting cast
will include…

00:15:31.009 --> 00:15:37.529
Emily Blunt, Robert Downey Jr., Matt Damon,
Florence Pugh, Rami Malek, Benny Safdie, Josh

00:15:37.529 --> 00:15:43.440
Hartnett, Dane DeHaan, Jack Quaid, Matthew
Modine, Alden Ehrenreich, Kenneth Branagh,

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:47.079
David Dastmalchian, Jason Clarke, and many,
many more.

00:15:47.079 --> 00:15:51.680
"Oppenheimer" will blow up the box office
on July 21, 2023.

00:15:52.149 --> 00:15:57.050
"Oppenheimer" isn't the only star-studded
blockbuster that'll be hitting theaters on July 21.

00:15:57.050 --> 00:16:01.690
Despite being based on the brand of dolls
for young girls, 2023's "Barbie" is gathering

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:05.000
buzz thanks to the sheer number of talented
people involved.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:09.769
Oscar nominee Greta Gerwig stepped up to direct
and co-write the film alongside her partner,

00:16:09.769 --> 00:16:11.930
fellow Oscar nominee Noah Baumbach.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:16.769
When Margot Robbie and Ryan Gosling were announced
as the future Barbie and Ken, the internet

00:16:16.769 --> 00:16:18.950
started to get really excited.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:23.089
We still don't know all that much about the
plot of "Barbie," but set photos suggest a

00:16:23.089 --> 00:16:26.500
neon-colored aesthetic inspired by the 1990s.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:32.200
Robbie and Gosling will be joined by a spectacular
supporting cast, including Simu Liu, America

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:37.930
Ferrera, Issa Rae, Kate McKinnon, Hari Nef,
Michael Cera, and Will Ferrell.

00:16:38.281 --> 00:16:43.810
Phase 4 of the MCU has been an interesting
project so far, as it's used both feature

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:48.840
films and its streaming shows on Disney+ to
introduce new characters and concepts.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:52.750
Now, one of the big payoffs for these introductions
is almost here.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:57.730
Directed by Nia DaCosta, "The Marvels" will
unite Carol Danvers with her best friend's

00:16:57.730 --> 00:17:01.889
daughter, Monica Rambeau, and the newly minted
Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan.

00:17:01.889 --> 00:17:04.250
"My costume is near perfect, just pending
the final flourish."

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.819
"Still trying to think of that flourish."

00:17:05.819 --> 00:17:09.309
"It'll come to me - sure it will- any second
now…"

00:17:09.309 --> 00:17:13.299
Beyond the cast, which also includes Samuel
L. Jackson returning as Nick Fury, we don't

00:17:13.299 --> 00:17:15.329
know much about the film's plot just yet.

00:17:15.329 --> 00:17:19.730
Of course, Carol, Monica, and Kamala have
a lot of shared comic book history, so we

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:25.320
can't wait to see some sparks fly when "The
Marvels" arrives on July 28, 2023.

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:31.900
In the summer of 2023, the DCEU will get one
of their most interesting new additions yet:

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.440
the fan favorite "Blue Beetle."

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:39.590
Directed by Angel Manuel Soto, the film will
star Xolo Maridueña as Jaime Reyes, a teenager

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:45.190
from El Paso who encounters an alien artifact
that takes the form of a mysterious blue scarab.

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:49.700
When he interacts with it, it fits to his
body and grants him an alien exosuit with

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:54.520
extraordinary powers, turning him into the
superhero known as Blue Beetle.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:59.200
Alongside Maridueña are co-stars Harvey Guillen,
Bruna Marquezine, George Lopez, and Raoul

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.200
Max Trujillo.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:04.680
Plus, Susan Sarandon will be starring as a
new villain created specifically for the film.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:08.469
"Blue Beetle" flies into theaters August 18,
2023.

00:18:08.857 --> 00:18:14.250
It's been nearly a decade since "The Conjuring"
arrived in theaters, and the franchise shows

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.350
no signs of slowing down.

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:20.650
In addition to the three films in the main
"Conjuring" series, several spinoff movies

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:24.710
have now developed into sub-franchises of
their own, — most notably, the evil doll

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:25.900
series "Annabelle."

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:30.250
Now, yet another "Conjuring" offshoot is set
to move into sequel territory.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:36.090
In 2023, Warner Bros. will release "The Nun
2," a continuation of the saga of the demonic

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:37.090
spirit Valak.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:42.030
Taissa Farmiga is expected to return for the
sequel as Sister Irene, a woman battling evil

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:46.860
in mid-20th century Europe, while Bonnie Aarons
will once again play the evil nun.

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:51.080
Director Michael Chaves will helm the film,
and "Malignant" writer Akela Cooper will handle

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.230
scripting duties.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:58.033
Valak will be back in time for the 2023 Halloween
season, arriving on September 8 of that year.

00:18:58.277 --> 00:19:03.480
Ever since "Venom" dropped in 2018, Sony Pictures
has been slowly building a Marvel universe

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.480
of their own.

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:09.160
In 2023, we'll get two new installments in
that budding franchise, beginning with "Kraven

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:12.760
the Hunter," the first big-screen take on
the title character.

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:17.659
Discussed as a possible Spider-Man movie villain
as far back as the Sam Raimi days, Kraven

00:19:17.659 --> 00:19:22.160
is a hunter who travels the world, taking
down the deadliest game on the planet.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:26.860
That eventually leads him to Spider-Man, a
powerful adversary who Kraven sees as the

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:28.030
ultimate prey.

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:32.179
The new version of the character may not face
off against Spider-Man, but he'll be portrayed

00:19:32.179 --> 00:19:35.059
by former Avenger Aaron Taylor-Johnson.

00:19:35.059 --> 00:19:39.830
Alongside him will be Ariana DeBose as Calypso,
Christopher Abbott as Foreigner, and Fred

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:42.470
Hechinger as Kraven's half-brother Chameleon.

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:46.270
Alessandro Nivola and Russell Crowe are also
slated to star.

00:19:46.270 --> 00:19:50.650
"Kraven the Hunter" will be on the prowl starting
October 6, 2023.

00:19:51.228 --> 00:19:56.870
After reinvigorating the "Halloween" franchise
with his 2018 legacy sequel, director David

00:19:56.870 --> 00:20:01.010
Gordon Green is turning his attention to another
iconic horror series.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:06.659
In 2020, Green was announced as the director
for a new installment in "The Exorcist" franchise,

00:20:06.659 --> 00:20:11.000
setting the stage for a story that will build
on the original film's tale of a young girl

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.419
possessed by a frightening evil.

00:20:13.419 --> 00:20:17.230
Screen legend Ellen Burstyn will return to
play Chris MacNeil, the mother of the young

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.310
girl possessed by the demon Pazuzu in the
first film.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:24.890
Now, Chris will be called upon to help another
family whose child is possessed, possibly

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:28.679
by the same evil force that tried to claim
her daughter decades earlier.

00:20:28.679 --> 00:20:32.720
Joining Burstyn in the film is "Hamilton"
breakout Leslie Odom Jr., who will play the

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:34.860
father of the newly possessed child.

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:39.570
Beyond those details, we don't know much yet,
but Green's experience revisiting horror classics

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:41.780
makes this a project to watch out for.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:48.517
The film is set to release on the very spooky
date of Friday the 13th of October 2023.

00:20:49.005 --> 00:20:54.470
Well before his first "Dune" film was released
in the fall of 2021, filmmaker Denis Villeneuve

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:59.270
made it clear that he was aiming for multiple
installments: his first film was just half

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.850
of Frank Herbert's epic novel.

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:05.600
Now, thanks to the first movie's success,
"Dune: Part Two" is on its way, and it seems

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:09.420
set to present something even grander than
its predecessor.

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:13.500
The original film's cast are all set to reprise
their roles — save for the characters who

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.650
didn't survive the first chapter.

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:19.539
Joining them this time around are Florence
Pugh, who will play Princess Irulan, Austin

00:21:19.539 --> 00:21:23.940
Butler as the Harkonnen fighter Feyd-Rautha,
Christopher Walken as the Emperor Shaddam

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:27.440
IV, and Lea Seydoux as Lady Margot.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:31.669
The film will pick up where the first installment
left off, as Paul Atreides and his mother

00:21:31.669 --> 00:21:36.039
join the Fremen in their fight against the
Harkonnen invasion of Arrakis.

00:21:37.072 --> 00:21:38.552
"My road leads into the desert…

00:21:41.355 --> 00:21:42.918
I can see it."

00:21:43.124 --> 00:21:47.062
"Dune: Part Two" touches down on November
3, 2023.

00:21:47.336 --> 00:21:52.970
Aquaman's been part of the DC Extended Universe
since 2016's "Batman v. Superman," but he

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:58.420
really exploded in popularity back in 2018
when he finally got his very own big-screen

00:21:58.420 --> 00:21:59.510
solo adventure.

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:04.799
An "Aquaman" sequel was previously slated
for the 2022 holiday season, but now, we'll

00:22:04.799 --> 00:22:08.429
have to wait an extra year to see "Aquaman
and the Lost Kingdom."

00:22:08.429 --> 00:22:10.850
What exactly is the Lost Kingdom?

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:15.150
We don't know for sure yet, but we do know
that Jason Momoa's Aquaman will be teaming

00:22:15.150 --> 00:22:19.210
up with his disgraced half-brother Orm to
fight the powerful Black Manta.

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:24.250
We'll also see the return of Amber Heard as
Mera, Temuera Morrison and Nicole Kidman as

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:29.950
Arthur's parents, Willem Dafoe as Atlantean
vizier Vulko, and Randall Park as marine biologist

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:31.650
Dr. Stephen Shin.

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:36.480
Joining the cast for the first time are Jani
Zhao, Indya Moore, and Pilou Asbæk.

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:41.270
Plus, Ben Affleck will reprise his role as
the Caped Crusader himself, Batman.

00:22:41.270 --> 00:22:47.273
"Aquaman and the Lost Kingdom" will finally
reveal its secrets on Christmas Day, 2023.

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:53.870
Martin Scorsese's next film is a highly anticipated
reunion with two of his most frequent collaborators.

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:58.850
The legendary director has cast both "The
Departed" star Leonardo DiCaprio and "Taxi

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:03.820
Driver" star Robert De Niro in key roles for
"Killers of the Flower Moon," his upcoming

00:23:03.820 --> 00:23:06.830
adaptation of the true-crime book of the same
name.

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:11.549
Based on a true story, the film is set in
1920s Oklahoma and follows the investigations

00:23:11.549 --> 00:23:16.830
into a series of murders of Native Americans,
leading to the formation of the FBI.

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:21.510
Also prepare to see Jesse Plemmons give the
performance of his career, as he'll play lead

00:23:21.510 --> 00:23:23.600
FBI investigator Tom White.

00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:27.710
Sadly, we'll have to wait a while before we
can finally watch "Killers of the Flower Moon."

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:32.750
Though the film was originally expected to
have a 2022 awards season run, Deadline reported

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:37.771
that the release has been pushed back to some
time in 2023, probably to give the film a

00:23:37.771 --> 00:23:40.250
world premiere at a major film festival.

